### Option 2: HTML/JavaScript (USD to Cambodian Riel Converter)
This is a simple, beautiful, and interactive web page script. It converts US Dollars (USD) to Cambodian Riel (KHR) using a standard exchange rate of **1 USD = 4,100 KHR**.

You can save this code as an `.html` file (e.g., `converter.html`) and double-click it to open it in any web browser!

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>USD to KHR Converter</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f7f6;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .converter-box {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            text-align: center;
            width: 350px;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #0056b3;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        input {
            width: 90%;
            padding: 12px;
            margin: 10px 0;
            border: 2px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
            outline: none;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        input:focus {
            border-color: #0056b3;
        }
        .result {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #28a745;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="converter-box">
    <h2>USD to KHR Converter</h2>
    <p>Enter amount in USD ($):</p>
    <input type="number" id="usdInput" placeholder="Enter USD amount" oninput="convertToRiel()">

    <div class="result" id="resultText">0 ៛ (Riel)</div>
</div>

<script>
    function convertToRiel() {
        const usdAmount = document.getElementById('usdInput').value;
        const exchangeRate = 4100; // 1 USD = 4100 KHR

        if (usdAmount && usdAmount >= 0) {
            const rielAmount = usdAmount * exchangeRate;
            // Format number with commas (e.g., 41,000)
            const formattedRiel = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-US').format(rielAmount);
            document.getElementById('resultText').innerText = `${formattedRiel} ៛`;
        } else {
            document.getElementById('resultText').innerText = "0 ៛ (Riel)";
        }
    }
</script>

</body>
</html>
```

